{"version":1,"content":"<p>英國首相安迪·伯納姆（Andy Burnham）將於周五籤署一項期待已久的協議，開始逐步調整英國脱歐後的相關安排。伯納姆此前曾表示，這一進程最終可能以英國申請重新加入歐盟告終。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587264.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:43:57.502484+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:33:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T08:37:15.226288+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:37:15.226288+00:00","content_hash":"f1ba498f47ed075c697eb7c8d7c51490244b8be145dccbc50c9fbaf5a82e6aa3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}